{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51073","headline":"七言记德诗三十首谨献司徒相公 安化 · 崔致远","name":"七言记德诗三十首谨献司徒相公 安化","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"班笔由起来不暗投，旋驱熊隼待封侯。\n郡名安化能宣化，更指河湟地欲收。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"崔致远","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51073.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51073","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}